Package: nv-monitor
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: __PKG_ARCH__
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.32)
Maintainer: __MAINTAINER__
Description: NVIDIA DGX Prometheus exporter
 nv-monitor is a single-file Prometheus exporter for the NVIDIA
 DGX Spark (Grace ARM CPU + GB10 Blackwell GPU). It exposes CPU,
 memory, GPU, NIC, and RDMA metrics over HTTP for Prometheus
 scraping.
